<title>USA: Wash. Water Pwr unit, Howard Energy form alliance.</title>
<headline>Wash. Water Pwr unit, Howard Energy form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Water Power Co's marketing unit, Avista Energy, has formed an alliance with Howard Energy Marketing Inc, a natural gas marketer based in Michigan, to form Howard/Avista Energy, LLC, the companies said Monday.</p>
<p>Avista said it invested $25 million and will hold a 50 percent stake in the venture.</p>
<p>The company, which will be headquartered in Traverse City, Mich., will market electricity and gas.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761))</p>
